"""Micras main board: the micromouse's MCU, power, motor drivers, sensors and user interface.

This root sheet holds the STM32H725RGV6 (IC1) with its supply network, the SWD header and the
test points, and connects the four sheets:
- REGULATORS (Regulators.zen): battery input, switch and measurement, supply selection,
  3.3 V buck, 20 V boost, SWD probe supply.
- DRIVERS (Drivers.zen): L6205D locomotion bridges with their shunts, STSPIN958 fan driver.
- SENSORS (Sensors.zen): IMU, motor current amplifiers, wall sensors, encoder slots.
- PERIPHERALS (Peripherals.zen): buttons, DIP switch, buzzer, LEDs, USB-C.

Parts of the MicrasMainBoard Altium design keep its designators, and the parts this board adds
continue each series. boards/main/previous/board.json is that design's connectivity; `micras-pcb
previous compare main` checks this board against it and boards/main/changes.toml.

MCU supply (DS13311 Rev 5; AN5419 Rev 3, Table 2 p7-8 and Figure 5 p10, "Direct SMPS
supply"). The VFQFPN68 package is SMPS-only (no VDDLDO pin), and the core runs from the
on-chip step-down converter:
- VDD (pins 9, 22, 35, 51, 68): 3V3 with C12-C16 100 nF, one per pin, and C17 4.7 uF.
- VDDSMPS (pin 6) = VDD: C1 10 uF and C2 4.7 uF.
- VLXSMPS (pin 5) to L1 2.2 uH (AFE201612S2R2MBT), whose other end is VCORE; C3 and C4 10 uF
  on VCORE at the inductor ("2 x 10 uF close to the inductor on VFBSMPS connection side").
- VFBSMPS (pin 7) and VCAP1-3 (pins 33, 49, 66) all on VCORE ("All VCAP connected together",
  Figure 5), with C7, C6 and C5 100 nF at VCAP1, VCAP2 and VCAP3. The firmware selects
  PWR_DIRECT_SMPS_SUPPLY, the supply configuration this wiring provides.
- VDDA (pin 16): 3V3 through the ferrite bead FB1 (600 Ohm at 100 MHz, 340 mOhm DCR), with
  C10 100 nF and C11 1 uF at the pin ("VDDA can be connected to VDD through a ferrite bead",
  1 uF + 100 nF at the pin, AN5419 Table 2 p7; the MB1520 discovery kit does the same). On this
  package VREF+ is VDDA (DS13311 Figures 46-47 note 1), so the bead keeps the wall-emitter
  pulses on 3V3 out of the ADC reference; the ADC's few mA drop under 2 mV across the DCR.
- VBAT (pin 1): 3V3, as AN5419 Table 2 requires when no backup battery is used (VBAT
  1.2-3.6 V, DS13311 Table 13 p116; 4.0 V absolute maximum, Table 10 p114), with C8 100 nF
  and C9 1 uF at the pin.

Debug connector P1 (JST SH SM05B-SRSS-TB, 5 pins at 1.00 mm, side entry on the board edge; the
probe cable ends in a JST SHR-05V-S housing): 1 SWD_VDD (the probe's 3.3 V supply, ORed onto
3V3 by U5 on the regulators sheet), 2 GND, 3 SWDIO, 4 SWCLK, 5 NRST, so the probe can connect
under reset (AN5419 Figure 21 p33). Its two reinforcement pads are on GND.

The board has no HSE or LSE crystal: PH1 and PC15 are unused. PA5 reads the battery voltage
(Battery_Voltage, ADC12_INP19) and PH0 the USB VBUS (USB_VBUS_Sense), both from dividers.
"""

load("@stdlib/interfaces.zen", "Spi")
load(
    "@stdlib/board_config.zen",
    "BoardConfig",
    "Constraints",
    "Copper",
    "CopperLayer",
    "DesignRules",
    "DielectricLayer",
    "Holes",
    "Material",
    "NetClass",
    "PredefinedSizes",
    "Silkscreen",
    "Stackup",
    "ViaDimension",
)
load("./passives.zen", "C_100N_0402", "C_10U_0603", "C_1U_0402", "C_4U7_0402", "FB_600R_0402")

Capacitor = Module("@stdlib/generics/Capacitor.zen")
FerriteBead = Module("@stdlib/generics/FerriteBead.zen")
AFE201612S2R2MBT = Module("github.com/Team-Micras/MicrasPCB/components/magnetsyc/AFE201612S2R2MBT/AFE201612S2R2MBT.zen")
SM05B_SRSS_TB = Module("github.com/Team-Micras/MicrasPCB/components/jst/SM05B-SRSS-TB/SM05B-SRSS-TB.zen")
STM32H725RGV6 = Module("github.com/Team-Micras/MicrasPCB/components/st/STM32H725RGV6/STM32H725RGV6.zen")
MountingHole = Module("github.com/Team-Micras/MicrasPCB/components/micras/MountingHole/MountingHole.zen")
TestPoint = Module("github.com/Team-Micras/MicrasPCB/components/micras/TestPoint/TestPoint.zen")
Regulators = Module("./Regulators.zen")
Drivers = Module("./Drivers.zen")
Sensors = Module("./Sensors.zen")
Peripherals = Module("./Peripherals.zen")

# Supplies.
# 3S LiPo on J1, 9.9-12.6 V in use (4.2 V per cell full; hw_debug/schematic_review.md, rework O1).
VBAT = Power("VBAT", voltage="9.9V to 12.6V")
# L6981C33 fixed output (DS13554 Table 6 p6: 3.284-3.346 V), or the SWD probe's 3.3 V through U5.
V3V3 = Power("3V3", voltage="3.3V")
# The ADC and analog supply, 3V3 through FB1.
VDDA = Power("VDDA", voltage="3.3V")
# USB VBUS from the USB-C receptacle: 4.75-5.25 V at the host, 4.4 V minimum at a device.
V5V = Power("+5V", voltage="4.4V to 5.25V")
# The SWD probe's 3.3 V supply on P1 pin 1 (an ST-Link V2 clone drives its 3.3 V regulator here).
SWD_VDD = Power("SWD_VDD", voltage="3.3V")
# TPS61178 output set by R39/R40: 1.198 V x (1 + 1 MOhm / 68 kOhm) = 18.82 V typ; 18.19-19.42 V
# over VREF (1.180-1.210 V, SLVSDA7E section 7.5), 1 % resistors and the 60 nA FB leakage
# through R39.
V20V = Power("+20V", voltage="18.19V to 19.42V")
# STM32 core supply from the on-chip SMPS: VOS3 to VOS0 (DS13311 Table 13 p117).
VCORE = Power("VCORE", voltage="0.95V to 1.40V")
# SMPS switching node; AN5419 Table 2 gives its range as VCORE in the Direct SMPS supply.
SMPS_LX = Power("SMPS_LX", voltage="0.95V to 1.40V")
GND = Ground("GND")
# Battery pack minus, switched to GND by Q6.
GND_BAT = Net("GND_BAT")

# MCU signals (names as in the firmware's pin map).
RESET = Net("Reset")
BOOT = Net("Boot")
SWDIO = Net("SWDIO")
SWCLK = Net("SWCLK")
USBD_P = Net("USBD_P")
USBD_N = Net("USBD_N")
BUTTON = Net("Button")
BUZZER = Net("Buzzer")
LED_ARGB = Net("LED_ARGB")
LED_RED = Net("LED_Red")
SWITCH_0 = Net("Switch_0")
SWITCH_1 = Net("Switch_1")
SWITCH_2 = Net("Switch_2")
SWITCH_3 = Net("Switch_3")

SPI_SCK = Net("SPI_SCK")
SPI_MISO = Net("SPI_MISO")
SPI_MOSI = Net("SPI_MOSI")
IMU_SPI = Spi(CS=Net("IMU_SPI_CSn"), CLK=SPI_SCK, MISO=SPI_MISO, MOSI=SPI_MOSI)
ENCODER_LEFT_SPI = Spi(CS=Net("Encoder_Left_CSn"), CLK=SPI_SCK, MISO=SPI_MISO, MOSI=SPI_MOSI)
ENCODER_RIGHT_SPI = Spi(CS=Net("Encoder_Right_CSn"), CLK=SPI_SCK, MISO=SPI_MISO, MOSI=SPI_MOSI)
IMU_INT1 = Net("IMU_INT1")
IMU_INT2 = Net("IMU_INT2")
ENCODER_LEFT_ABI_A = Net("Encoder_Left_ABI_A")
ENCODER_LEFT_ABI_B = Net("Encoder_Left_ABI_B")
ENCODER_RIGHT_ABI_A = Net("Encoder_Right_ABI_A")
ENCODER_RIGHT_ABI_B = Net("Encoder_Right_ABI_B")

WALL_SENSOR_PWM_0 = Net("Wall_Sensor_PWM_0")
WALL_SENSOR_PWM_1 = Net("Wall_Sensor_PWM_1")
WALL_SENSOR_PWM_2 = Net("Wall_Sensor_PWM_2")
WALL_SENSOR_PWM_3 = Net("Wall_Sensor_PWM_3")
WALL_SENSOR_0 = Net("Wall_Sensor_0")
WALL_SENSOR_1 = Net("Wall_Sensor_1")
WALL_SENSOR_2 = Net("Wall_Sensor_2")
WALL_SENSOR_3 = Net("Wall_Sensor_3")

MOTOR_LEFT_PWM_FW = Net("Motor_Left_PWM_FW")
MOTOR_LEFT_PWM_BW = Net("Motor_Left_PWM_BW")
MOTOR_RIGHT_PWM_FW = Net("Motor_Right_PWM_FW")
MOTOR_RIGHT_PWM_BW = Net("Motor_Right_PWM_BW")
MOTORS_ENABLE = Net("Motors_Enable")
MOTOR_L_SENSE_P = Net("Motor_L_Sense+")
MOTOR_L_SENSE_N = Net("Motor_L_Sense-")
MOTOR_R_SENSE_P = Net("Motor_R_Sense+")
MOTOR_R_SENSE_N = Net("Motor_R_Sense-")
CURRENT_SENSOR_LEFT = Net("Current_Sensor_Left")
CURRENT_SENSOR_RIGHT = Net("Current_Sensor_Right")

FAN_PWM = Net("Fan_PWM")
FAN_ENABLE = Net("Fan_Enable")
FAN_TOFF = Net("Fan_TOFF")

BATTERY_VOLTAGE = Net("Battery_Voltage")
USB_VBUS_SENSE = Net("USB_VBUS_Sense")

# MCU.
STM32H725RGV6(
    name="IC1",
    VDD=V3V3,
    VDDSMPS=V3V3,
    VDDA=VDDA,
    VBAT=V3V3,
    VLXSMPS=SMPS_LX,
    VFBSMPS=VCORE,
    VCAP1=VCORE,
    VCAP2=VCORE,
    VCAP3=VCORE,
    GND=GND,
    NRST=RESET,
    BOOT0=BOOT,
    PA0=ENCODER_LEFT_ABI_A,
    PA1=ENCODER_LEFT_ABI_B,
    PA2=BUZZER,
    PA3=ENCODER_LEFT_SPI.CS,
    PA4=WALL_SENSOR_3,
    PA5=BATTERY_VOLTAGE,
    PA6=WALL_SENSOR_2,
    PA7=BUTTON,
    PA8=MOTOR_RIGHT_PWM_FW,
    PA9=MOTOR_RIGHT_PWM_BW,
    PA10=MOTORS_ENABLE,
    PA11=USBD_N,
    PA12=USBD_P,
    PA13=SWDIO,
    PA14=SWCLK,
    PA15=ENCODER_RIGHT_ABI_B,
    PB0=SWITCH_1,
    PB1=WALL_SENSOR_0,
    PB2=SWITCH_2,
    PB3=ENCODER_RIGHT_ABI_A,
    PB4=IMU_INT2,
    PB5=IMU_INT1,
    PB6=WALL_SENSOR_PWM_0,
    PB7=WALL_SENSOR_PWM_1,
    PB8=WALL_SENSOR_PWM_2,
    PB9=WALL_SENSOR_PWM_3,
    PB10=SWITCH_3,
    PB12=LED_RED,
    PB13=FAN_TOFF,
    PB14=FAN_ENABLE,
    PB15=FAN_PWM,
    PC0=CURRENT_SENSOR_LEFT,
    PC1=CURRENT_SENSOR_RIGHT,
    PC4=WALL_SENSOR_1,
    PC5=SWITCH_0,
    PC6=LED_ARGB,
    PC7=MOTOR_LEFT_PWM_FW,
    PC9=MOTOR_LEFT_PWM_BW,
    PC10=SPI_SCK,
    PC11=SPI_MISO,
    PC12=SPI_MOSI,
    PC14=ENCODER_RIGHT_SPI.CS,
    PC15=NotConnected(),
    PD2=IMU_SPI.CS,
    PH0=USB_VBUS_SENSE,
    PH1=NotConnected(),
)

Capacitor(name="C1", P1=GND, P2=V3V3, **C_10U_0603)
Capacitor(name="C2", P1=GND, P2=V3V3, **C_4U7_0402)
AFE201612S2R2MBT(name="L1", P1=VCORE, P2=SMPS_LX)
Capacitor(name="C3", P1=GND, P2=VCORE, **C_10U_0603)
Capacitor(name="C4", P1=GND, P2=VCORE, **C_10U_0603)
Capacitor(name="C7", P1=GND, P2=VCORE, **C_100N_0402)
Capacitor(name="C6", P1=GND, P2=VCORE, **C_100N_0402)
Capacitor(name="C5", P1=GND, P2=VCORE, **C_100N_0402)
Capacitor(name="C8", P1=GND, P2=V3V3, **C_100N_0402)
Capacitor(name="C9", P1=GND, P2=V3V3, **C_1U_0402)
FerriteBead(name="FB1", P1=V3V3, P2=VDDA, **FB_600R_0402)
Capacitor(name="C10", P1=GND, P2=VDDA, **C_100N_0402)
Capacitor(name="C11", P1=GND, P2=VDDA, **C_1U_0402)
Capacitor(name="C12", P1=GND, P2=V3V3, **C_100N_0402)
Capacitor(name="C13", P1=GND, P2=V3V3, **C_100N_0402)
Capacitor(name="C14", P1=GND, P2=V3V3, **C_100N_0402)
Capacitor(name="C15", P1=GND, P2=V3V3, **C_100N_0402)
Capacitor(name="C16", P1=GND, P2=V3V3, **C_100N_0402)
Capacitor(name="C17", P1=GND, P2=V3V3, **C_4U7_0402)

# SWD connector: probe supply, GND, SWDIO, SWCLK, NRST; reinforcement pads on GND.
SM05B_SRSS_TB(name="P1", P1=SWD_VDD, P2=GND, P3=SWDIO, P4=SWCLK, P5=RESET, MP=GND)

# Test points (bare pads, not assembled). The 20V pad has no connection.
TestPoint(name="IMU_INT1", prefix="IMU_INT", P1=IMU_INT1)
TestPoint(name="IMU_INT2", prefix="IMU_INT", P1=IMU_INT2)
TestPoint(name="FAN_PWM", prefix="FAN_PWM", P1=FAN_PWM)
TestPoint(name="FAN_ENABLE", prefix="FAN_ENABLE", P1=FAN_ENABLE)
TestPoint(name="FAN_OVERCURRENT", prefix="FAN_OVERCURRENT", P1=FAN_TOFF)
TestPoint(name="20V", prefix="20V", P1=NotConnected())

# M2 screw holes to the chassis; spec/main.toml places them.
MountingHole(name="H1")
MountingHole(name="H2")
MountingHole(name="H3")
MountingHole(name="H4")

Regulators(
    name="REGULATORS",
    VBAT=VBAT,
    V3V3=V3V3,
    V5V=V5V,
    V20V=V20V,
    SWD_VDD=SWD_VDD,
    GND=GND,
    GND_BAT=GND_BAT,
    MOTORS_ENABLE=MOTORS_ENABLE,
    BATTERY_VOLTAGE=BATTERY_VOLTAGE,
)

Drivers(
    name="DRIVERS",
    VBAT=VBAT,
    V3V3=V3V3,
    V20V=V20V,
    GND=GND,
    MOTOR_LEFT_PWM_FW=MOTOR_LEFT_PWM_FW,
    MOTOR_LEFT_PWM_BW=MOTOR_LEFT_PWM_BW,
    MOTOR_RIGHT_PWM_FW=MOTOR_RIGHT_PWM_FW,
    MOTOR_RIGHT_PWM_BW=MOTOR_RIGHT_PWM_BW,
    MOTORS_ENABLE=MOTORS_ENABLE,
    MOTOR_R_SENSE_P=MOTOR_R_SENSE_P,
    MOTOR_R_SENSE_N=MOTOR_R_SENSE_N,
    MOTOR_L_SENSE_P=MOTOR_L_SENSE_P,
    MOTOR_L_SENSE_N=MOTOR_L_SENSE_N,
    FAN_PWM=FAN_PWM,
    FAN_ENABLE=FAN_ENABLE,
    FAN_TOFF=FAN_TOFF,
)

Sensors(
    name="SENSORS",
    V3V3=V3V3,
    GND=GND,
    IMU_SPI=IMU_SPI,
    IMU_INT1=IMU_INT1,
    IMU_INT2=IMU_INT2,
    MOTOR_L_SENSE_P=MOTOR_L_SENSE_P,
    MOTOR_L_SENSE_N=MOTOR_L_SENSE_N,
    MOTOR_R_SENSE_P=MOTOR_R_SENSE_P,
    MOTOR_R_SENSE_N=MOTOR_R_SENSE_N,
    CURRENT_SENSOR_LEFT=CURRENT_SENSOR_LEFT,
    CURRENT_SENSOR_RIGHT=CURRENT_SENSOR_RIGHT,
    WALL_SENSOR_PWM_0=WALL_SENSOR_PWM_0,
    WALL_SENSOR_PWM_1=WALL_SENSOR_PWM_1,
    WALL_SENSOR_PWM_2=WALL_SENSOR_PWM_2,
    WALL_SENSOR_PWM_3=WALL_SENSOR_PWM_3,
    WALL_SENSOR_0=WALL_SENSOR_0,
    WALL_SENSOR_1=WALL_SENSOR_1,
    WALL_SENSOR_2=WALL_SENSOR_2,
    WALL_SENSOR_3=WALL_SENSOR_3,
    ENCODER_RIGHT_SPI=ENCODER_RIGHT_SPI,
    ENCODER_RIGHT_ABI_A=ENCODER_RIGHT_ABI_A,
    ENCODER_RIGHT_ABI_B=ENCODER_RIGHT_ABI_B,
    ENCODER_LEFT_SPI=ENCODER_LEFT_SPI,
    ENCODER_LEFT_ABI_A=ENCODER_LEFT_ABI_A,
    ENCODER_LEFT_ABI_B=ENCODER_LEFT_ABI_B,
)

Peripherals(
    name="PERIPHERALS",
    VBAT=VBAT,
    V3V3=V3V3,
    V5V=V5V,
    GND=GND,
    BUTTON=BUTTON,
    RESET=RESET,
    BOOT=BOOT,
    SWITCH_0=SWITCH_0,
    SWITCH_1=SWITCH_1,
    SWITCH_2=SWITCH_2,
    SWITCH_3=SWITCH_3,
    BUZZER=BUZZER,
    LED_ARGB=LED_ARGB,
    LED_RED=LED_RED,
    USBD_P=USBD_P,
    USBD_N=USBD_N,
    USB_VBUS_SENSE=USB_VBUS_SENSE,
)

# Stackup and rules from the Altium MicrasMainBoard.PcbDoc (layer stack and design rules):
# 4 layers, 1 oz outer / 0.5 oz inner copper, 0.2104 mm prepreg (Dk 4.4) and 0.5 mm core
# (Dk 4.48), 1.0412 mm with mask. Rules: 0.1 mm clearance, 10 mil (0.254 mm) preferred track,
# 0.45 / 0.3 mm vias, 0.2 mm copper to board edge. The track widths and the other via sizes are
# the ones its routing uses.
Board(
    name="main",
    path="layout",
    layers=4,
    schematic=True,
    config=BoardConfig(
        design_rules=DesignRules(
            constraints=Constraints(
                copper=Copper(
                    minimum_clearance=0.1,
                    minimum_track_width=0.1,
                    minimum_via_diameter=0.4,
                    copper_to_edge_clearance=0.2,
                ),
                holes=Holes(minimum_through_hole=0.3, hole_to_hole_clearance=0.254),
                # Silkscreen text down to 0.5 mm high with a 0.15 mm stroke: the previous board's
                # reference designators were 0.5 mm / 0.154 mm, and the owner read them on the
                # fabricated board. JLCPCB guarantees legibility from 1.0 mm high and 0.153 mm
                # stroke; this board accepts smaller text. The stroke minimum is set by
                # `micras-pcb rules` (rules/kicad-severities.toml [design.main]): Zener has no field
                # for it.
                silkscreen=Silkscreen(minimum_text_height=0.5),
            ),
            predefined_sizes=PredefinedSizes(
                track_widths=[0.2, 0.2248, 0.254, 0.3, 0.4, 0.6, 0.8, 1.0],
                via_dimensions=[
                    ViaDimension(diameter=0.45, drill=0.3),
                    ViaDimension(diameter=0.5, drill=0.3),
                    ViaDimension(diameter=0.8, drill=0.4),
                ],
            ),
            netclasses=[
                NetClass(
                    name="Default",
                    clearance=0.1,
                    track_width=0.254,
                    via_diameter=0.45,
                    via_drill=0.3,
                    diff_pair_width=0.2248,
                    diff_pair_gap=0.127,
                ),
            ],
        ),
        stackup=Stackup(
            materials=[
                Material(name="NP-155F prepreg", relative_permittivity=4.4),
                Material(name="NP-155F core", relative_permittivity=4.48),
            ],
            thickness=1.0412,
            layers=[
                CopperLayer(thickness=0.035, role="mixed"),
                DielectricLayer(thickness=0.2104, material="NP-155F prepreg", form="prepreg"),
                CopperLayer(thickness=0.0152, role="mixed"),
                DielectricLayer(thickness=0.5, material="NP-155F core", form="core"),
                CopperLayer(thickness=0.0152, role="mixed"),
                DielectricLayer(thickness=0.2104, material="NP-155F prepreg", form="prepreg"),
                CopperLayer(thickness=0.035, role="mixed"),
            ],
        ),
    ),
)
